  "$comment": "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for Citrus default fantasy scoring. Every other copy is derived: packages/shared/src/constants/scoringDefaults.ts imports this file; scripts/gen-scoring-defaults.mjs generates data-pipeline/scoring/scoring_defaults.py and docs/generated/SCORING_DEFAULTS.md from it (run `npm run gen:scoring`; CI fails when they are stale). Change a weight here, regenerate, done. The SQL homes (stat_catalog, the zero-UUID league_scoring_rules rows, the leagues.scoring_settings column default, the projection-rebuild RPCs) still carry literals in supabase/migrations and must ship a migration alongside any change here.",
